Convex 1.41.0. `internal.crons.markExpired` is an internal mutation that checks `Date.now()` and marks due subscriptions with `isExpired: true`. It takes no arguments. A public query reads the persisted flags.

In `convex/crons.ts`:
```ts
import { cronJobs } from "convex/server";
import { internal } from "./_generated/api";

// markExpired is defined in this file.
const crons = cronJobs();
// Insert the registration here.
export default crons;
```
